.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt VPS-DEPLOY 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vps-deploy
.Nd deploy approved pub4 services to the production VPS
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm all | master | brgen | amber | bsdports
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the serialized production deploy entry point at
.Pa OPENBSD/bin/vps-deploy .
Run it as the unprivileged deploy account
.Cm dev ,
not as root and not through
.Xr doas 1 .
The script escalates only for the individual steps that require it.
.Pp
The command validates its target, checks required local broker availability,
validates bounded timing and capacity settings, obtains the deploy lock, and
runs the configured preflight, synchronization, CI, restart, health and deploy
stamp steps.
The exact order and restore behavior are implemented in the script
and the production runbook.
.Pp
The accepted targets are
.Cm all ,
.Cm master ,
.Cm brgen ,
.Cm amber ,
and
.Cm bsdports .
Unknown targets are refused before deployment.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "VPS_DEPLOY_PREFLIGHT_SHA"
.It Ev VPS_DEPLOY_SHA
Commit to deploy.
The default is fetched from
.Cm origin/main
once.
.It Ev VPS_DEPLOY_PREFLIGHT_SHA
Commit whose boot was already proved by the operator's machine.
.It Ev VPS_DEPLOY_SKIP_PREFLIGHT
Break-glass preflight bypass.
Setting this to
.Cm 1
also requires
.Ev I_UNDERSTAND_FAST_DEPLOY=1 .
.It Ev SKIP_CI
When set to
.Cm 1 ,
skips
.Pa vps_ci.sh ;
the per-application deploy script and runtime gate still run.
.It Ev VPS_DEPLOY_DRIFT
Setting this to
.Cm fail
refuses deployment when machine configuration differs from the repository.
.It Ev PUB4_DEPLOY_BROWSER_GATES
Setting this to
.Cm 1
adds the browser gates after restart.
.El
.Sh SECURITY
Do not run as root.
Do not bypass preflight during ordinary deployments.
A
successful synchronization or TLS response alone does not establish that every
application is healthy.
Inspect the actual health and deploy receipt.
.Pp
Before live work, read
.Pa OPENBSD/RUNBOOK.md
and the owning tree README.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
zsh OPENBSD/bin/vps-deploy --help
zsh OPENBSD/bin/vps-deploy master
zsh OPENBSD/bin/vps-deploy all
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr operator 1 ,
.Xr pub4-admin 8 ,
.Xr rcctl 8 ,
.Xr relayd 8
